<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
  <script is:inline async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-KMVG0NPRG5"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
    function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
    gtag('js', new Date());
    gtag('config', 'G-KMVG0NPRG5');
  </script>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <meta name="description" content="SkipTheLatte Privacy Policy — How we handle your data."/>
  <title>Privacy Policy — SkipTheLatte</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    :root{
      --blue:#1763B6;--blue-h:#1357a0;--blue-bg:#eaf1fb;
      --bg:#ffffff;--bg2:#f7f8fa;--border:#e5e8eb;--border2:#dde1e7;
      --text:#0a0a0a;--text2:#5c6370;--text3:#9ea5b0;
      --font:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;
    }
    html{font-family:var(--font);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    body{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none}
    a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    .nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 24px}
    .nav-logo{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:-.02em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .logo-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue)}
    .nav-back{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);padding:6px 13px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;transition:all .12s}
    .nav-back:hover{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;background:var(--blue-bg)}
    main{flex:1;padding:0 24px 80px}
    .wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto}
    .hero{padding:56px 0 40px}
    .hero-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .hero-eyebrow::before{content:'';width:20px;height:2px;background:var(--blue)}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:14px}
    .hero-sub{font-size:16px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.65}
    .section{margin-bottom:40px}
    .section-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
    .section-title::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border2)}
    .prose h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;margin-top:24px}
    .prose h3:first-child{margin-top:0}
    .prose p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:12px}
    .prose ul{padding-left:20px;margin:8px 0 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
    .prose li{font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6}
    footer{background:var(--bg2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    footer p{font-size:12px;color:var(--text3)}
    .foot-brand{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <a class="nav-logo" href="/">
    <span class="logo-dot"></span>
    SkipTheLatte
  </a>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:6px">
    <a class="nav-back" href="/faq">FAQ</a>
    <a class="nav-back" href="/">← Calculator</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Legal</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Last updated: June 2025. This policy explains how SkipTheLatte collects and uses information.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">Overview</div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h3>No personal data collected</h3>
      <p>SkipTheLatte (lattecalc.com) is a free, client-side Bitcoin opportunity cost calculator. We do not require registration, accounts, or any personal information to use this tool.</p>

      <h3>Information we collect automatically</h3>
      <p>We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to understand how visitors use this site. This may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent</li>
        <li>General geographic location (country/city level)</li>
        <li>Browser type and device information</li>
        <li>Referring website</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This data is aggregated and anonymized. We do not identify individual users.</p>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>Google Analytics uses cookies to distinguish users. You can opt out via <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

      <h3>Local storage</h3>
      <p>Your browser's <code>localStorage</code> is used solely to remember your preferred currency setting across visits. No data is transmitted to any server.</p>

      <h3>Advertising</h3>
      <p>This site displays ads via <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Google may use cookies to serve personalized ads based on your browsing history. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

      <h3>Third-party links</h3>
      <p>This site contains links to external websites (e.g., CoinGecko, StackFreedom). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>

      <h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>For privacy-related questions, please use our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="foot-brand">
    <span class="logo-dot" style="width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--blue);border-radius:50%;display:inline-block"></span>
    SkipTheLatte
  </div>
  <p>© 2025 SkipTheLatte · For informational purposes only · Not financial advice</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
